## 4. Role in the ODS architecture

```text
USER / WORKLOAD
       ↓
MODEL PROFILE (family + qualified checkpoint)
       ↓
HARDWARE + STORAGE PROFILE
       ↓
ODS CAPABILITY REGISTRY (Runtime Registry)
       ↓
EXECUTION STRATEGY (ICD)
       ↓
RUNTIME SELECTOR
       ↓
 ┌──────────────────┬────────────────────┬─────────────────┬─────────┐
 │ llama-server     │ cafe-llama.cpp     │ TensorFold      │ Strata / │
 │ (baseline)       │ (advanced MoE)     │ (family-specific│ others   │
 │                  │                    │  + exact draft) │         │
 └──────────────────┴────────────────────┴─────────────────┴─────────┘
       ↓
UNIFIED ODS API (OpenAI-compatible)
       ↓
LEONES validation / evidence
```

TensorFold is **not** a generic llama-server drop-in. It should activate only when the ICD selector matches hardware + family + checkpoint in the registry. Otherwise fall back to cafe-llama or llama-server with a clear Dashboard message.

